30 hours Review:
I am not sure what I can say about this game that you guys can't already see in the videos and screenshots....
This game has got EPIC graphics and I LOVE the gameplay!
What I like:
1) The fact that it is open world;
2) You can choose when and if you want to follow the story;
3) You can choose when and if you want to do missions and side missions;
4) Changed your mind after accepting a mission......just walk away.
5) The graphics......OMG....the graphics......Are EPIC and really beautiful;
6) You get to sail a pirate ship....I mean......does it get any better than that;
7) The gameplay;
8) The controls;
9) YOU GET YOUR OWN PIRATE ISLAND!!!!! AND YOU CAN UPGRADE AND BUILD ON IT!!!!!;
10) You can enlarge the docks at your island and get lots and lots and lots of boats in your fleet;
11) Your character can be customised and upgraded;
12) Your ship can be customised and upgraded;
13) The ocean, waves, day night and also the weather in this game was very well thought out.
14) THE GRAPHICS!!!!!!
That is what I like in the game (so far).....only 30 hours in and did not do a lot of missions and story stuff, as I like to get on my ship and go wherever the currents and winds take me.
What I don't like:
Nothing so far....wil report back as I log more hours.
