Really liked it. I'm a d&d and sci fi fan and this game really gets them both well. First of all u get to customize your GM (galaxy master) with all kinds of sci fi references, such as star trek suits, darth vader costume, battle star galactica and so much more. Next u've got these references all over the place that add to the humour of this game, it really cant get any more of it. Sometimes in the game u get to wwrite your own story (not much but still enough to satisfy the choice). The battle game play is a bit pokemon-ish, its turned based and u choose for each character what item and skill to use, but its appropriate because of the d&d "gameplay" it tries to resseble, and it does a great job ding it. As u go through the story u will unlock more game mechanics such as your own missions and new characters to your party. After this game im waiting for GOP&P2!
TLDR: FOR: d&d, pokemon or sci fi fans;
NOT FOR: deep lore and hardcore fans.
